<title>UK: Blue Circle H1 pre-tax profits rise 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Blue Circle H1 pre-tax profits rise 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		8.9		    vs 8.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.25		   vs 4.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     116.3		  vs 104.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   874.4		  vs 839.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits for Blue Circle Industries Plc were in a range of 90.0 million to 116.5 million stg.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 121.5		  vs 112.5</p>
<p> Interest		   5.2		    vs 8.4</p>
<p> Tax			  39.3		   vs 34.2</p>
<p> Net taxed		  77.0		   vs 69.9</p>
<p> Attributable	     69.6		   vs 65.2</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 25 1996</p>
<p> Div registration date  September 17 1996</p>
<p> Ex-div date		September 9 1996</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
